<title>SWITZERLAND: Interroll shares begin at 250 Sfrs.</title>
<headline>Interroll shares begin at 250 Sfrs.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Swiss conveyor belt and moving systems manufacturer Interroll Group began their first trading day on Swiss stock exchanges at 250 Swiss francs.</p>
<p>The group said on Wednesday it had set a price of 235 francs per registered share on its first issue, which involved the sale of 461,160 shares, out of a total of 854,000 shares created when it announced it would seek a public listing.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
